# Intent & Scenario Catalogue vs Architecture (CM-03)

Coverage of the inbound-servicing input catalogue (32 intents, 30 scenarios) against the
19-Nov architecture and its tools. Imported from the Google Sheet
`CM03_Intent_Scenario_vs_Architecture_Tools` on 2026-11-19.

**Fit** — `Aligned`: catalogue and architecture agree · `Aligned (architecture adds)`:
architecture covers a case the catalogue didn't · `Partial`: covered with caveats ·
`Gap`: not yet handled.

**Tool matrix legend** — ● tool is called or decides the outcome · ○ only in some cases ·
blank not used. Every turn also runs normalize, screen, plan and the output guard.

